    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trizon is a rogue-like deckbuilding game. Players take on the role of an escapee relentlessly pushing forward to  find a way out. The game combines auto-battler mechanics, where creatures attack on their own, with instant-effect spell cards. Battles are fast-paced and dynamic, set against a simple and restrained art style, making both in-battle and out-of-battle decisions equally significant and thought-provoking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players can...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use creatures and spells to control the battlefield, defeating all enemy creatures to secure victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fuse any two cards in your deck to create completely overpowered single-card combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Merge countless creatures to cultivate your own unique, ultimate fusion monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plan your route and take risks to achieve greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anticipate the flow of battle, triggering a series of fully automated chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft infinite loops, defeating any opponent in a single turn with limitless combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter adorable card illustrations, making your adventure feel less lonely.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trizon is a rogue-like deckbuilding game. Players take on the role of an escapee relentlessly pushing forward to  find a way out. The game combines auto-battler mechanics, where creatures attack on their own, with instant-effect spell cards. Battles are fast-paced and dynamic, set against a simple and restrained art style, making both in-battle and out-of-battle decisions equally significant and thought-provoking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players can...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use creatures and spells to control the battlefield, defeating all enemy creatures to secure victory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fuse any two cards in your deck to create completely overpowered single-card combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Merge countless creatures to cultivate your own unique, ultimate fusion monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plan your route and take risks to achieve greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anticipate the flow of battle, triggering a series of fully automated chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft infinite loops, defeating any opponent in a single turn with limitless combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter adorable card illustrations, making your adventure feel less lonely.</p></li></ul>",
